@1    = ~Greetings, which deed brings you to our city?~
@2    = ~Mind your own business!~
@3    = ~I have scores to settle.~
@4    = ~What silly question, the adventure obviously...~
@5    = ~Your face looks familiar, are you wanted or something?~
@6    = ~Me wanted, ha ha, no of course... Well, have a nice day.~
@7    = ~I'm watching you citizens !~
@8    = ~If you have a conflict to resolve, ask the garrison commander in the basement of the Ducal Palace.~
@9    = ~No fights, got it. Do you have any other information about the city's affairs?~
@10   = ~Don't be so flammable, it's time for me to go. Goodbye.~
@11   = ~If you have a conflict to resolve, ask the commander, its garrison was installed in a house just outside the palace.~
@12   = ~If you're seeking adventure, Elorin, the magician recently installed in the tower of Ramazith, is constantly asking to the Flaming Fist about a quest of great importance... At least for him...~
@13   = ~I'll meet this magician as soon as possible. Do you have any other information on city affairs?~
@14   = ~And you're back, do you need anything?~
@15   = ~Do you have any other information on city affairs?~
@16   = ~The daughter of a Flaming Fist figure has been abducted, it seems that the thugs behind the numerous murders try to prevent further investigation.~
@17   = ~It is truly terrible! What can we do?~
@18   = ~I really don't care...~
@19   = ~What's this child's name?~
@20   = ~Our options are limited, but you're not really affiliated with the Flaming Fist. Persevere with your investigation and find this innocent girl!~
@21   = ~Very well, the current trail leads to the personnel working in Duke Opas' quarters at the Ducal Palace.~
@22   = ~On second thought, I really don't care...~
@23   = ~Rohma... Rohma Corwin.~
@24   = ~I see...~
@25   = ~Your indifference will turn against you. There is nothing more to say.~
@26   = ~Thank you, I wish you to succeed.~
@27   = ~We have nothing more to say to each other.~
@28   = ~You've brought the child back. Thank you so much!~
@29   = ~You left the child on her own in a murderers' nest, what did you expect...~
@30   = ~<CHARNAME> ! Nice to see you !~
@31   = ~The Duc Opas is very popular lately, handling all matters of importance.~
@32   = ~Hmm, the Dukes of Baldur's Gate are always different. Do you have any other information on city affairs?~
@33   = ~A mission of the highest importance!~
@34   = ~The same applies to you, Rohma~
@35   = ~Taverns! I need a drink!~
@36   = ~Les Three Old Kegs will do, but don't let Vito the tavern-keeper persuade you to drink more than you should...~
@37   = ~I like Vito already! Do you have any other information on city affairs?~
@38   = ~Some concerns about the Three Old Kegs, but don't let Vito the tavern-keeper persuade you to drink more than you should...~



